/insidetheguardian" role="menuitem">Inside the Guardian</a></li><li role="none" class="dcr-e7kv8"><a class="selectableMenuItem dcr-ecn700" href="https://www.theguardian.com/weekly?INTCMP=gdnwb_mawns_editorial_gweekly_GW_TopNav_US" role="menuitem">Guardian Weekly</a></li><li role="none" class="dcr-e7kv8"><a class="selectableMenuItem dcr-ecn700" href="/crosswords" role="menuitem">Crosswords</a></li><li role="none" class="dcr-e7kv8"><a class="selectableMenuItem dcr-ecn700" href="https://www.wordiply.com" role="menuitem">Wordiply</a></li><li role="none" class="dcr-e7kv8"><a class="selectableMenuItem dcr-ecn700" href="/theguardian/series/corrections-and-clarifications" role="menuitem">Corrections</a></li><li role="none" class="dcr-e7kv8"><a class="selectableMenuItem dcr-ecn700" href="https://www.theguardian.com/tips" role="menuitem">Tips</a></li></ul></li><li role="none" class="dcr-r65df2"><form action="https://www.google.co.uk/search" class="dcr-l5bz30"><label for="gu-search-desktop" class="dcr-0"><div class="dcr-3hufd7">Search input </div></label><input type="text" id="gu-search-desktop" required="" name="q" placeholder="Search the Guardian" class="selectableMenuItem dcr-1lp5d41"/><label for="gu-search-desktop" class="dcr-0"><div class="dcr-3hufd7">google-search </div><div class="dcr-4w99e1"><span class="dcr-1iiavsd">Search</span></div></label><button type="submit" aria-label="Search with Google" class="dcr-1qq9q4v"><div class="src-button-space"></div></button><input type="hidden" name="as_sitesearch" value="www.theguardian.com"/></form><ul role="menu" class="dcr-9j2uad"><li class="dcr-1tzh05h"><a class="selectableMenuItem dcr-4j9y7f" href="https://theguardian.newspapers.com" role="menuitem">Digital Archive</a></li><li class="dcr-1tzh05h"><a class="selectableMenuItem dcr-4j9y7f" href="https://licensing.theguardian.com/" role="menuitem">Guardian Licensing</a></li><li class="dcr-1tzh05h"><a class="selectableMenuItem dcr-4j9y7f" href="https://www.theguardian.com/guardian-